WEBVTT

00:23:56.079 --> 00:24:00.079
because when we go into a room and we sit
with a lot of people we don't know

00:24:00.079 --> 00:24:03.871
and we learn about the world and what
we learn about the world is

00:24:03.871 --> 00:24:08.663
a lie in terms of race, in terms of gender
, in terms of sexuality,

00:24:08.663 --> 00:24:13.954
in terms of religion. Those lies being
projected 40 feet high in front of tens

00:24:13.954 --> 00:24:18.538
of millions, if not hundreds of millions
of people have real human substantive

00:24:18.538 --> 00:24:22.121
consequences, particularly
for black lives.

00:24:22.454 --> 00:24:24.329
You know, I've increasingly,

00:24:24.329 --> 00:24:26.579
over the last few months been
struck by the notion that

00:24:26.579 --> 00:24:29.329
the first ever Hollywood blockbuster
was birth of a nation.

00:24:29.871 --> 00:24:33.038
And, you know, we're seeing the
consequences of it now.